{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17130","headline":"临川羡鱼 · 张正元","name":"临川羡鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客百愁侵，求鱼正在今。\n广川何渺漫，高岸几登临。\n风水宁相阻，烟霞岂惮深。\n不应同逐鹿，讵肯比从禽。\n结网非无力，忘筌自有心。\n永存芳饵在，伫立思沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张正元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}